      "releaseNotes": "New features:\n- Now supports satellite cellular data! Requires suitable device (iPhone 14 or later) and satellite data support from your carrier.\n- New radar view.\n- New settings screen: Change data rate interval for both cellular and satellite connections.\n- New 'PureTrack link code', to make it easy to link to your other PureTrack tracking devices.\n\nMinor improvements:\n- Browsing back to trackers list no longer stops tracking.\n- See when points were last sent and received by PureTrack.\n- Altitude and speed now listed in multiple different units.\n- Tracking on/off button moved to bottom for easy thumb access.",
