      "description": "PureTrack is the best way to share your adventures with friends and family.\n\n- Location data is shown on the puretrack.io website.\n- Live track your location over cellular OR satellite cellular data*!\n- Easily share your live location with your friends on any computer or device with a simple web link.\n- Add multiple trackers or aircraft that you fly. Switch between them easily. Handy if you're jumping between multiple aircraft or vehicles often.\n- PureTrack works worldwide, anywhere you've got cellular signal.\n- Track aircraft, paragliders, gliders, vehicles, boats, kayaks, bikes, dogs, cats, people, anything you like!\n- See all your friends on the same map.\n- Merge cellular tracking from this app with SPOT and InReach satellite trackers, ADSB, FLARM and OGN tracking data, for the ultimate coverage anywhere you go adventuring.\n- View tracks of where you've been.\n- See aircraft from around the world.\n\n*Satellite data requires iPhone 14 or later, and must be supported by your cellular carrier.",
